<article class="env-lemma" id="04AW">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04AW">Lemma <span data-tag="04AW">4.18.6</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category. The following are equivalent: </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
Nonempty finite colimits exist in $\mathcal{C}$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
Coproducts of pairs and coequalizers exist in $\mathcal{C}$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
Coproducts of pairs and pushouts exist in $\mathcal{C}$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
