<article class="env-lemma" id="002Q">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/002Q">Lemma <span data-tag="002Q">4.18.7</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category. The following are equivalent: </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
Finite colimits exist in $\mathcal{C}$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
Finite coproducts and coequalizers exist in $\mathcal{C}$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The category has an initial object and pushouts exist. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
